    }
  ],
  "locations": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": "The Tideline",
      "description": "You stand on a shingle beach at the edge of evening. The sea draws back and comes in again, turning over the stones with a sound like breathing. North, a path climbs the cliff toward a lighthouse. Its lamp is dark. East, the ribs of a wrecked ship stick up out of the sand. West, the land goes low and wet into salt marsh. South, an old jetty runs out into the grey.\n\n(Type 'help' if you want it.)",
      "connections": { "north": 2, "east": 6, "west": 8, "south": 10 },
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "tideline-sea",
          "triggers": ["*sea*", "*water*", "*waves*", "*tide*", "*swim*"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["The water is cold enough to hurt. Far out there is nothing, no sail and no shore, only the dark coming in from the east. Whatever brought you here didn't come by sea, or if it did, it's gone."] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "tideline-stones",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*shingle*", "*pebble*"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["The stones are smooth and grey, each one the size of a palm. There is a flat place on the cliff path above where people have been piling them."] }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": "The Cliff Path",
      "description": "The path zigzags up the cliff face, cut into the rock and worn into a groove by feet. Halfway up there is a flat ledge that looks out over the whole bay. Someone has cleared a patch of ground here, as if meaning to build something, and then left. Shingle from the beach lies about. The lighthouse is north; the beach is south.",
      "connections": { "north": 3, "south": 1 },
      "interactions": [
        {
          "interactionId": "cairn-again",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*cairn*", "*pile*", "*build*", "*place*"],
          "if": ["placed_stone"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["You have already set your stone. You couldn't say which one it is now, and that seems to be the point."] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "cairn-1",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*cairn*", "*pile*", "*build*", "*place*"],
          "ifNot": ["placed_stone", "cairn1"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["placed_stone"], "scope": "player" },
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["cairn1"], "scope": "world" },
            { "action": "setlocationdescription", "parameters": ["2", "The path zigzags up the cliff face, cut into the rock and worn into a groove by feet. Halfway up there is a flat ledge that looks out over the whole bay. On the cleared ground, one smooth stone sits by itself. It's the start of something, if anyone else comes. The lighthouse is north; the beach is south."] },
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["You pick a stone off the path, turn it over once, and set it in the middle of the cleared ground. It's only one stone, but it's the first. Whoever comes up this path next will see that someone came before them."] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "cairn-2",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*cairn*", "*pile*", "*build*", "*place*"],
          "if": ["cairn1"],
          "ifNot": ["placed_stone", "cairn2"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["placed_stone"], "scope": "player" },
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["cairn2"], "scope": "world" },
            { "action": "setlocationdescription", "parameters": ["2", "The path zigzags up the cliff face, cut into the rock and worn into a groove by feet. Halfway up there is a flat ledge that looks out over the whole bay. On the cleared ground, two stones sit one on top of the other. That makes it a cairn, just barely. The lighthouse is north; the beach is south."] },
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["There is a single stone here already, set down by someone you'll never meet. You balance yours on top of it. Now there are two."] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "cairn-3",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*cairn*", "*pile*", "*build*", "*place*"],
          "if": ["cairn2"],
          "ifNot": ["placed_stone", "cairn3"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["placed_stone"], "scope": "player" },
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["cairn3"], "scope": "world" },
            { "action": "setlocationdescription", "parameters": ["2", "The path zigzags up the cliff face, cut into the rock and worn into a groove by feet. Halfway up there is a flat ledge that looks out over the whole bay. A small cairn stands on the cleared ground, three stones high and leaning a little toward the sea. The lighthouse is north; the beach is south."] },
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["Two stones, stacked by two strangers. You find one that fits and add it. Three. It leans a little toward the sea, the way everything up here does."] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "interactionId": "cairn-4",
          "triggers": ["*stone*", "*cairn*", "*pile*", "*build*", "*place*"],
          "if": ["cairn3"],
          "ifNot": ["placed_stone", "cairn4"],
          "actions": [
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["placed_stone"], "scope": "player" },
            { "action": "addcondition", "parameters": ["cairn4"], "scope": "world" },
            { "action": "setlocationdescription", "parameters": ["2", "The path zigzags up the cliff face, cut into the rock and worn into a groove by feet. Halfway up there is a flat ledge that looks out over the whole bay. A cairn stands on the ledge, four stones high. It holds up well in the wind. The lighthouse is north; the beach is south."] },
            { "action": "describe", "parameters": ["You set a fourth stone on the cairn. It rocks, then settles. From down on the beach it would just be a dark mark on the cliff, but it would be there."] }
